  "srv.lab":"Service","srv.h2":"More than a deal","srv.p":"We meet you, drive you, and help on the ground. Terms agreed personally — just tell us what you need.","srv.transfer":"Viewing transfer","srv.meet":"Airport pickup","srv.clean":"Cleaning","srv.transfer.d":"We collect you and bring you back","srv.meet.d":"We meet your flight and drive you home","srv.clean.d":"For guests already staying with us","srv.cta":"Send a request","do.lab":"Advantages","do.h2":"Choosing, buying and moving is easy with us",
